OL,3,GNEWSAPensioner with 'largest hoard' of
OL,4,Achild abuse images found in Scotland
OL,5,Ajailed
OL,6,
OL,7,FA pensioner who amassed what is thought
OL,8,Fto be the largest collection of child
OL,9,Fsexual abuse material ever seized by
OL,10,Fpolice in Scotland has been jailed for
OL,11,Ffour years.
OL,13,FAlan MacPherson, 83, from
OL,14,FStenhousemuir, was found to have more
OL,15,Fthan two million images on various
OL,16,Felectronic devices after his home was
OL,17,Fraided in 2025.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
