OL,3,GNEWSAPensioner with 'largest hoard' of
OL,4,Achild abuse images found in Scotland
OL,5,Ajailed
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 805,000 were identified as
OL,8,Fdepicting child sexual abuse - much of
OL,9,Fit in the most serious category - while
OL,10,Fthe overwhelming scale of his
OL,11,Fcollection meant much of material was
OL,12,Fnot checked and categorised.
OL,14,FMacPherson was told by Sheriff Mayram
OL,15,FLabaki that the scale of his crime was
OL,16,F"exceptional".
